<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd">
<html>
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=euckr">
<title>PHPS.kr</title>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/xeicon/2/xeicon.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/1.9.1/jquery.min.js"></script>
<style type="text/css">
@import url(http://fonts.googleapis.com/earlyaccess/nanumgothic.css);
@import url(http://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Open+Sans:400,600);

html, body, pre,
h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6,
dl, dt, dd, ul, li, ol,
th, td, p, blockquote,
form, fieldset, legend,
menu, nav, section, hgroup, article, header, aside, footer,
input, select, textarea, button {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Open Sans', Nanum Gothic, monospace, Corbel, Dotum, AppleGothic, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

article, aside, details, figcaption, figure,
footer, header, hgroup, menu, nav, section {
        display: block;
}

body,
h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, table,
input, select, textarea, a {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #313131;
        font-family: 'Open Sans', Nanum Gothic, monospace, Corbel, Dotum, AppleGothic, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 { font-weight: normal }
img, fieldset, button { border: 0 none }
li { list-style: none }
hr, caption, legend { display: none }
a { color: #313131; text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { }
button { overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; }
button span { visibility: hidden }
address, em { font-style: normal }
select { line-height: 22px; height: 22px; }
input:focus { outline: none }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; table-layout: fixed; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: keep-all; }

input, select {border:1px solid #e1e1e1; vertical-align:middle }
textarea {border:1px solid #e1e1e1; vertical-align:middle; padding: 2px 0 0 2px }
input[type=checkbox], input[type=radio], input[type=image] { border:0 }

#wrap { position:relative; width:100% }

#phpsTopArea { position:relative; width:100%; height:77px; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5 }
#phpsTopArea .phpsTop { margin:0 auto; position:relative; width:1100px }
#phpsTopArea .phpsTop .tlogo { padding-top:21px }

#phpContentArea { position:relative; width:100% }

#columnMessege { margin:0 auto; position:relative; width:1100px; height:379px; background:url(http://www.phps.kr/img/phps_index/bg_column_messege.jpg) 100% bottom no-repeat }
#columnMessege .bx_messege { padding-top:100px }
#columnMessege .bx_messege .t1 { font-size:42px; color:#111; font-weight:bold }
#columnMessege .bx_messege .t2 { padding-top:15px; font-size:32px; color:#1a4f98 }
#columnMessege .bx_messege .t3 { padding-top:15px; font-size:20px; color:#555; line-height:28px }

#columnBottom { padding:20px 0 50px; position:relative; border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5 }

#columnBnnr { margin:0 auto; padding-top:30px; position:relative; width:1100px }

#phpsFooterArea { margin-top:50px; position:relative; border-top:1px solid #e1e1e1 }
#phpsFooterArea .columnQuick { height:40px; border-bottom:1px solid #e1e1e1 }
#phpsFooterArea .columnQuick ul { margin:0 auto; position:relative; width:1100px; height:40px; border-left:1px solid #e1e1e1; border-right:1px solid #e1e1e1; *zoom:1 }
#phpsFooterArea .columnQuick ul:after { display:block; clear:both; content:'' }
#phpsFooterArea .columnQuick ul li { margin-left:-1px; float:left; width:219px; height:40px; text-align:center; border-left:1px solid #e1e1e1 }
#phpsFooterArea .columnQuick ul li a { display:block; height:40px; font-size:14px; color:#313131; font-weight:bold; line-height:40px }

#phpsFooterArea .phpsFooter { margin:0 auto; position:relative; width:1100px; *zoom:1 }
#phpsFooterArea .phpsFooter:after { display:block; clear:both; content:'' }
#phpsFooterArea .phpsFooter .flogo { padding-top:23px; float:left }
#phpsFooterArea .phpsFooter .ft_right { padding-top:25px; float:right; text-align:right }
#phpsFooterArea .phpsFooter .ft_right span { color:#d8d8d8 }
</style>
<script type="text/javascript">
<!--
        $(document).ready(function(){
                var url = "https://ad-api.phpschool.com/phps_pc/settingpage/bottom/bundle?bundlenum=1";
                $.ajax({
                        url : url,
                        dataType: "json",
                        success : function(data) {
                                var imgHtml = "";
                                $.each(data,function(key,value){
                                        imgHtml += "<a href='"+value.JURL1+"' target='_blank'><img src='"+value.IMG1+"' /></a>";
                                });                             
                                $("#columnBnnr").append(imgHtml); 
                        },
                        error: function (xhr, ajaxOptions, thrownError) {}
                });
        });
//-->
</script>
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap">
    <div id="phpsTopArea">
        <div class="phpsTop">
            <h1 class="tlogo"><a href="https://www.phps.kr/" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.phps.kr/img/common/tlogo.jpg" alt="PHPS.kr" /></a></h1>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="phpContentArea">
        <div id="columnMessege">
            <div class="bx_messege">
                <p class="t1">404 Error</p>
                <p class="t2">페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.</p>
                <p class="t3">
                    웹페이지의 주소가 변경되었거나 존재하지 않습니다.<br />
                    페이지주소가 정확한지 확인해주세요.(영문 대소문자 구분)
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="columnBottom">
            <div id="columnBnnr">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="phpsFooterArea">
        <div class="columnQuick">
            <ul>
                <li class="first"><a href="https://www.phps.kr/customer_faq.html" target="_blank"><span class="tx">FAQ</span></a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.phps.kr/customer_menual.html" target="_blank"><span class="tx">서비스매뉴얼</span></a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.phps.kr/customer_consult.html" target="_blank"><span class="tx">1:1맞춤상담</span></a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.phps.kr/allpay_list.html" target="_blank"><span class="tx">서비스연장</span></a></li>
                <li><a href="http://domain.phps.kr/domain_price/" target="_blank"><span class="tx">도메인등록비용</span></a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="phpsFooter">
            <h2 class="flogo"><a href="https://www.phps.kr/" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.phps.kr/img/common/flogo.jpg" alt="PHPS.kr" /></a></h2>
            <div class="ft_right">
                <p>메일 : <a href="https://www.phps.kr/customer_mail_consult.html" target="_blank">helpcenter@phps.kr</a></p>
                <p>COPYRIGHT WWW.PHPS.KR(스쿨호스팅). ALL RIGHT RESERVED</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
